sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant UI as PWA
  participant API as Focused API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as QStash Scheduler / Queue
  participant W as Notification Worker
  participant Push as Browser Push Service
  participant SW as Service Worker

  U->>UI: Enable push for a category
  UI->>U: Request browser permission in user gesture
  U-->>UI: Grant
  UI->>SW: register + PushManager.subscribe(VAPID)
  SW-->>UI: endpoint + encryption keys
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/push-subscriptions
  API->>DB: Store protected capability endpoint and keys

  U->>API: Create recurring reminder
  API->>DB: Save rule, timezone, quiet hours, and outbox event
  API->>Q: Enqueue occurrence expansion
  Q->>W: Signed job callback
  W->>DB: Materialize bounded future occurrences idempotently
  W->>Q: Schedule occurrence delivery

  Q->>W: Deliver due occurrence (signed, retryable)
  W->>DB: Lock occurrence and load preference snapshot
  W->>W: Apply quiet hours, caps, expiry, dedupe
  W->>Push: Encrypted Web Push using VAPID
  Push-->>SW: push event
  SW-->>U: Privacy-safe notification
  W->>DB: Record delivery attempt and terminal/retry state

  alt Endpoint returns 404 or 410
    W->>DB: Revoke subscription and stop endpoint retries
  else Transient 429 or 5xx
    W-->>Q: Retryable failure with backoff
  end
